# UI

Full detail: `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`. Tokens live in `src/app/globals.css`
under Tailwind v4's `@theme`.

Editorial, not e-commerce-template: generous type, a lot of paper, one
accent used sparingly.

## Tokens only

Utilities, never hex. `bg-ek-paper`, `text-ek-green-900`,
`border-ek-green-200`.

- Ink: `ek-green-900`. Body: `ek-green-700`. Page: `ek-paper` — **never
  pure white**.
- **`gold-800` is the only gold that passes 4.5:1 as ink.** `gold-500` and
  `gold-600` are fills only. This is the likeliest way to lose the
  accessibility 100.
- `ek-terracotta` is the chilli accent and error text.

## Type

Display **Marcellus 400 only** — hierarchy from size, tracking and case,
never synthesised weight. Body Figtree.

`text-64` (home hero only) · `text-46` · `text-34` · `text-26` · `text-20`
lead · `text-17` body · `text-15` secondary. **Nothing smaller than
`text-15`.** Line heights are in the tokens; do not override.

Prose never exceeds `max-w-[70ch]`; body usually sits at 52–68ch.

## Layout

Container `mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-5 lg:px-8`, or `720px` for prose.
Sections `py-16 lg:py-24`, or `py-20 lg:py-28` to breathe.

**Asymmetry is the house style** — `lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]`, not
`1fr 1fr`. An even split reads as a template.

`<SoilLine />` between major sections, never inside one.

## Components before divs

`Button` / `ButtonLink`, `Eyebrow` (`as="h2"` when it is the heading),
`SoilLine`, `Reveal`, `PhotoPlaceholder`, `GIChip`, `Breadcrumbs`.

`PhotoPlaceholder` carries the **art direction** for the shot that belongs
there. There is no stock photography in this project, deliberately.

## Server components by default

`"use client"` has a byte cost against a tight budget. Push interactivity to
the smallest leaf. Need rich content inside a client component? Render it on
the server and pass it as a `node` prop.

## Accessibility — the gate is 100

- 4.5:1 on body text; never remove a focus ring.
- `min-h-11` on every button, link-button and input — 44×44 minimum.
- Every input has a **visible** `<label>`; a placeholder is not a label.
- Errors next to the field, not only summarised at the top.
- One `<h1>`; heading levels do not skip.
- `aria-label` on icon-only buttons, `role="status"` on status messages,
  `aria-hidden` on decorative SVG.
- A keyboard path for everything. Drag-to-reorder also has ↑/↓ buttons
  because native HTML5 drag is mouse-only.

## Motion

150–300ms, and it must mean something. Colour and opacity only — never
`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`. Everything respects
`prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Copy

Plain, specific, unhurried. **Never fabricate social proof.** Say what
happens next — "Waiting to be sent", not "Thank you for your order", when
it has not been sent. Refusals give the rule. No exclamation marks. Indian
English and formats: ₹ with `en-IN` grouping, IST. FSSAI-safe: no disease,
cure or treatment claims.
